3.—(1) The following offences may be compounded by the Official Receiver in accordance with section 271(1) of the Act:
(a)an offence under section 71(8), 94(14), 166(10), 208(3) or 237(1) of the Act;
(b)an offence (other than a further offence that is punishable with a default penalty under section 267(1) of the Act) under section 73(4), 81(3), 82(2), 83(4), 84(5), 85(6), 97(3), 100(9), 105(3), 106(4), 108(8), 111(8), 115(6), 132(3), 140(4), 141(5), 148(4), 149(6), 160(3), 165(7), 171(4), 179(3), 180(4), (8) or (9), 182(3), 186(5), 191(4), 192(1) or (2), 194(3) or 211(6) of the Act;
(c)an offence under section 146(3) of the Act punishable under section 266(2) of the Act;
(d)an offence (other than a continuing offence) under section 243(3) of the Act;
(e)an offence under section 266(1) of the Act punishable under section 266(2) of the Act.
(2) The following offences may be compounded by the Registrar of Companies (if so authorised under section 271(3) of the Act) in accordance with section 271(4) of the Act:
(a)an offence under section 71(8), 94(14) in respect of a contravention of section 94(5)(a), 166(10), 208(3) or 237(1) of the Act;
(b)an offence (other than a further offence that is punishable with a default penalty under section 267(1) of the Act) under section 73(4), 81(3), 82(2), 83(4) in respect of a contravention of section 83(1)(c)(i), 85(6) in respect of a contravention of section 85(1)(a), 97(3), 100(9) in respect of a contravention of section 100(8), 105(3) in respect of a contravention of section 105(1)(a), 106(4) in respect of a contravention of section 106(6), 108(8), 111(8), 115(6), 132(3), 140(4), 141(5) in respect of a contravention of section 141(3)(a), 148(4), 149(6), 160(3), 165(7), 180(4) or (8), 182(3), 186(5), 191(4), 192(2), 194(3) or 211(6) of the Act;
(c)an offence (other than a continuing offence) under section 243(3) of the Act;
(d)an offence under section 266(1) of the Act punishable under section 266(2) of the Act, in respect of anything that the person is required or directed to do by the Registrar of Companies or any provision that the person contravenes or fails to comply with in relation to the Registrar of Companies.

4. The following offences may be compounded by the Official Assignee in accordance with section 437(1) of the Act:
(a)an offence under section 38(3), 40(2), 44(7), 313(4), 334(6)(a), (b) or (c), 369(6), 398(2), 400(3), 401(3) or 403(3)(a) or (b) or (4) of the Act;
(b)an offence (other than a continuing offence) under section 332(6)(a) or (b) or 333(2) of the Act;
(c)an offence under any of the following sections of the Act punishable under section 417 of the Act:
Section 405(1)(a) or (b), 412(1)(a), (b) or (c), 413(1)(a) or (b), 414(1)(a) or (b) or 415(a) or (b) of the Act.
